== Section 1 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section2">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">

<blockquote>"How could it be worse?" l asked them.</blockquote>

<blockquote>It is better that Hatep and his children come and crush Foundation into a thousand pieces, than they suffer defeat. The Shamoe Gri-Liif saved us. She was selfless."</blockquote>

<blockquote>I read their prophecy in the shelter, away from the howl, where it had been mounted above a bed like a prayer.</blockquote>

<blockquote>Comes one to challenge Hatep, clouds of faces, risen and violent.</blockquote>

<blockquote>This I took to mean Sabor.</blockquote>

<blockquote>Another waits, over a mountain of gold.</blockquote>

<blockquote>Which must have meant the Kioki..</blockquote>

<blockquote>There must be a way to defy it and a glad new realm shall unfold.</blockquote>

<blockquote>"Glad" was perhaps going a little too far.</blockquote>

